LEFT JOIN: Display the first name, last name, and if they have a dinner reservation, for all VIPs

SELECT vips.last_name, vips.first_name, reservations.dinner_rsvp
FROM vips
LEFT JOIN reservations
ON vips.member_id = reservations.member_id
AND reservations.dinner_rsvp = 1
ORDER BY vips.last_name;

INNER JOIN: Display the VIPs who attended a workshop

SELECT vips.last_name, vips.first_name, events.event_type
FROM vips
INNER JOIN events
ON vips.event = events.event_id
WHERE events.event_type = 'Workshop'
ORDER BY vips.last_name;

MULTIPLE JOINS: Which VIPs have an event and a dinner reservation?

SELECT vips.last_name, vips.first_name, events.event_name, reservations.dinner_rsvp
FROM vips
INNER JOIN events
ON vips.event = events.event_id
INNER JOIN reservations
ON vips.member_id = reservations.member_id
WHERE reservations.dinner_rsvp = 1
ORDER BY vips.last_name;

SELF JOIN: Using the vips table, make a list of all VIPs who provide feedback to another VIP. Include the member_id, VIP’s name, and the name of the VIP receiving the feedback. Order the results by the member_id of the VIP giving feedback in ascending order

SELECT A.member_id, A.first_name AS giver_first_name, B.first_name AS receiver_first_name
FROM vips A
INNER JOIN vips B
ON A.provides_feedback_to = B.member_id
ORDER BY A.member_id ASC;

SUBQUERY: Write a query that selects the member IDs of all VIPs who are attending workshop events

SELECT member_id
FROM vips
WHERE event IN(
SELECT event_id
FROM events
WHERE event_type = 'Workshop');

INNER JOIN: Display the VIPs who have a hotel reservation

SELECT vips.last_name, vips.first_name
FROM vips
INNER JOIN reservations
ON vips.member_id = reservations.member_id
WHERE reservations.hotel = 1
ORDER BY vips.last_name ASC;
